      "timestamp_raw": "Jan 9, 2025 15:04:29 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Just to document it in this thread, the ICPS registration has the Alata parent incorrectly listed as Alata \"Black\" when it is in fact Phil's Alata \"Black Throat\" used.  This is confirmed elsewhere on the internet, as well as can be seen in his 2024 seedlist where he redid the cross but used a Flava Atropurpurea instead of a Rubricorpora.  ",
